      "uid": "zhcn:1bd4e056da98c707995c0f0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要登记保存竞赛，\r\n就能再看一次\r\n精彩的竞赛呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db590f74e6dd18225a4d1720eb27adc743e144061ddbf1393780aba81d979b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04b2a0e9e8e0d6779e90fef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其他训练员的赛马娘\r\n也能作为练习同伴\r\n一起参加呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ab62e99eab602ba52a6026c2dc8fd80521c13643c75d7a563dc051389344cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3555e71dc8bb2beb5dac7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了签约赛马娘……\r\n亲自巡遍全国的赛场，\r\n这份心意……让人敬佩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7d600cac157dd4d1f5bb08425428cb66ff14c0aed5652eed65134cf2d7adb96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da3d2b0869e307273a8e2410",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "许多著名赛马娘都完成过\r\n这个练习……你们今日的努力，\r\n也会写下历史的一页。",
      "source_fingerprint": "251d9e79a7fbbb64484984f4ec6f40abcda52a918b593f95eac6e02e889e8088",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:554018c073e2d1a28d878f96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是模拟GⅠ竞赛的练习呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef978c0946118155809b4957cdfd1214b24e7acf632c8fc35208703fc1ed927",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88c2bdde8764abd3ac28abd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说是练习……但竟然能\r\n看到那样竞争激烈的GⅠ竞赛……\r\n啊啊，太让人兴奋了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94cf83dcbff12295ca0956aae6acc6d06c7718f8c18ada4c60eaa154e7e27da9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fe2db98a452554bdb24979c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望能在所有GⅠ竞赛中\r\n看见签约赛马娘的杰出表现……\r\n现在就能实现那个梦想了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b4f09a64ba8587e17953be7fa2fc1f004be0d2cda6b0408a243198d27fe4e1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd6a11db442cae449eb6d278",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "考虑距离和场地\r\n选择赛道吗？\r\n是很讲究的练习课表呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afcd5636dd70ac0bcba2c404fef3225b96a0f478c30d2670884ae9f9893d7592",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f08ef05912ba6e36cc1d2391",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要选择怎样的赛道呢？\r\n读者都特别关心\r\n训练员的竞赛计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0d42c910fd4a702fbd57e9b27ed30f62c57b815b64b98243fbb098caf79ead2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b6819c016a1f1ae3c9a40b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "选择各种赛道大获全胜……\r\n以完美无缺的赛马娘为目标，\r\n也是这个练习吸引人的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62bb180bf3b3b28b7184e05ca09a5408e86fb03aeb4f2aac40422970e628b19a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cd9d6c1473823dc442e0313",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "场地和参赛人数等条件\r\n都是竞赛的重要元素呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db678352a32d708fcc452e253a68cda3f2a4773e3dca7ead4d44cfbad601f790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a864ce445e1e63db7a9b599",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「无论在怎样的条件下都会正面\r\n迎击」……这份意志不用多说都能\r\n让人感受到！太厉害了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "981825098dc5a5b6d30ff5fdb64a3c14169f2c4f95fc786d45e07c7cef3be4ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e078e1e93a2ffe88f5e5948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气也是影响胜负的因素之一。\r\n试着重现历史上的著名竞赛……\r\n也是不错的选择吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9ca0b20461f80ec3707aa067d67a6665853c206690e79a2a3c0109ea157f962",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad296d6a8845c0579f4906f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于要登记参赛了呢。\r\n真让人期待竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c296cc3d779975aa24fbcbfcbf4548d17602c64387f9d778c32739bd5fb7081e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1b4fbf9405d92c61ac1119c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要登记参赛赛马娘呢。\r\n不知道这场竞赛将会如何发展，\r\n真令人期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2741eff1e3b3f0dec9b36a749211501aea2be0d717bff8353fdd81bd8105cd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ec90fe68676f01ecb79a38e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论由谁参赛，\r\n我都做好了采访的万全准备！\r\n爱用的记事本已经网罗所有数据♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb6c9a619b5e6c2460991955d80f1f06a7af7037356b9a48d69a4f6ee633d49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fea993da236b492cd032165d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次究竟会是谁\r\n踏入优胜者区域……身为记者\r\n和一名粉丝……我感到非常兴奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "baccab428d096a58a4458e4f81ac57252d3b6d2dd2ff2f585267468b9954c869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9003",
        "600017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1dd20696f527a6f4d1d2562",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们互相加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55ad9c2bca0e93d4835473836e4ba9488a7c6a8b91e587c0a94f9a865f850dc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9004",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6cf7ce91505c595a371db7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常荣幸能再度帮上您的忙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b8a7533bd0dc8f245c32e57a1d7ca2c84d1b3a884448677287f00054f51e0e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9004",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ed0113d10dc89fd67b39f1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样一定会变得更强的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e33b0bd82ee2a947521ca6a93f1f74ea18a051ad7319a6b84fd3ac08a98e455",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9004",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd010bfb2812bcf67b5b6430",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来“滋”地扎一针吧♪～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78bcee1a296486142668f037ca4531a346587db2bda4723bc8edc44f0cb09038",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9005",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:595922b868ce04677b21bb68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "失败？不会不会！哇哦，安心～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6040b11b352397525d2725a9b09fb93d529b63e26605a3268802b18b65664e25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9005",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67281984b8f1f6c17bf1ea44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功率说不定会上升哦～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6edb4dd1a931a663eb4bdc0effb721a424031322a62619604087dbe865c3bc80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9005",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b5e10fcf0ec686067d6789d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇哇！这样就超级安～心～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a8a5ad15f797d4196c73ae558eba5d822c35dd7a4f0ade9ecd47c66fc56026e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9005",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb4d72c4b54e695a452e31e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起合作吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abb82a34d30841ad7391d7ab866648be05afb971f0002497190ef9229eada2e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9006",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9990ae6f94a80f304b5601d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互相切磋有时也是必要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "079cef59325391cd3273c35b9386a0a0c1b7834a390135aea60425014f9bbb34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9006",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d8ff4dc83af656eb7da89a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "构建双赢的关系吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "907c5c5c97523b05e108cc97c28f61e34a93e9c81076bc5247206f2724b93af2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9006",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bf8ab8455a187434f943ac9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望能交换对我们彼此有利的情报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4b0cffcd98c4c36420128d20309d174cea6fe839c4a259cebf53a5252de1827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9006",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9562bc4668a32f551b94718b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来提供协助！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c964c098e417cff4c5143cdbdf87abea42520032902e68e893db856ef16d80f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9008",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e81ea4bad5ff83d7639dd91e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关于下一份企画，有什么打算吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "225a6824aff8e0c3d2ca051a2c37205f8f6e1eb8e8bff838c65e22716a8d1efd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9008",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b31236f7f266eafa4297afa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能帮得上忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58167f890e591554e5866881ef935857a89e24398cb87ee8ced9f0c1787e8bb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9008",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a398b4f7bd75e7d436faf0af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我应该能提供许多协助！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24eb4b6c737d296f6392f75fbef9044bcf2c04efc714f766ced016593765286d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9008",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6c6a429bb40431fa582e5c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d74a1210a77498310c9dc978ed30d400ceb29dba694d1da89666fab3d0c4e207",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9040",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c277cda730d56d12eb5d8fc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "告诉我有关你的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f453e7a6bab98db31edd9c4a48e72319a5ed767df9eec39197123f2282ca4bb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9040",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b78d171506c866d47047811",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我来照亮四周吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75bfa600ac90f1a7d66dd0cc87608b59456105caaa6407d41203277668e8746",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9040",
        "95005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
